### SQL injection payloads — the proxy SHOULD block each of these (expect 403).
#
# These target the two injectable forms in ../../cbr_project (login, register)
# plus arbitrary paths/headers served by echo_backend.py. Run them through the
# proxy on :8080, never straight at the backend on :5000.
#
# VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP client: click "Send Request" above each
# block. The separator is "###".

@proxy = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Classic tautology in the password field (the documented bypass -> admin)
POST {{proxy}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=x&password=1' OR '1' = '1

### Tautology in the email field
POST {{proxy}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=' OR 1=1 --&password=x

### Comment-out the rest of the query
POST {{proxy}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=admin'--&password=anything

### UNION-based extraction
POST {{proxy}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=' UNION SELECT id, name, email, password, admin FROM users --&password=x

### Register with an injected admin flag (string concatenation sink)
POST {{proxy}}/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=hacker', 'h@x.com', 'pw', 1) --&email=h@x.com&password=pw

### Stacked query / destructive statement
POST {{proxy}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=x'; DROP TABLE users; --&password=x

### Boolean-blind probe
POST {{proxy}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=x' AND 1=1 --&password=x

### Time-based blind (SQLite)
POST {{proxy}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=x' AND 1=randomblob(100000000) --&password=x

### Injection in a query-string parameter
GET {{proxy}}/search?q=' OR '1'='1

### UNION in the query string
GET {{proxy}}/items?id=1 UNION SELECT password FROM users

### JSON body injection
POST {{proxy}}/api
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "' OR 1=1 --", "password": "x"}

### Injection carried in a header (echo_backend logs it; real app may log it too)
GET {{proxy}}/
User-Agent: sqlmap' UNION SELECT 1 --

### Injection carried in a cookie (no spaces: /**/ stands in for them, since a
### cookie value is truncated at the first space before the filter sees it)
GET {{proxy}}/
Cookie: tracking=1'/**/OR/**/'1'='1

### URL-encoded tautology (proxy sees it decoded as ' OR '1'='1)
GET {{proxy}}/search?q=%27%20OR%20%271%27%3D%271

### Time-based blind injection (example_time_based detector)
POST {{proxy}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=x' AND SLEEP(5)--&password=x
